1
00:00:20,920 --> 00:00:23,325
♪Where can love ever be whole?♪

2
00:00:23,434 --> 00:00:27,719
♪When will the bright moon be full?♪

3
00:00:28,320 --> 00:00:30,597
♪Love and hate turn on a single thought♪

4
00:00:30,760 --> 00:00:35,310
♪The past is hard to leave, part,
or sever♪

5
00:00:35,600 --> 00:00:39,002
♪My true heart has never changed♪

6
00:00:40,120 --> 00:00:42,687
♪I wish to become paired swallows
with you♪

7
00:00:43,560 --> 00:00:48,356
♪To meet year after year♪

8
00:00:52,880 --> 00:00:55,816
=Phoenix Rising from the Faint Moon=

9
00:00:55,816 --> 00:00:58,577
(Adapted from the Fanqie Novel
Heaven-Sent Consort & Scheming Prince)

10
00:00:58,625 --> 00:00:59,244
(Author: Yun Jinque)

11
00:01:01,118 --> 00:01:04,082
=Episode 11=

12
00:01:04,599 --> 00:01:05,119
Darn.

13
00:01:05,599 --> 00:01:06,639
You're saying

14
00:01:07,119 --> 00:01:09,559
Mo Xuanji was behind

15
00:01:10,039 --> 00:01:10,960
the noodle shop incident?

16
00:01:11,119 --> 00:01:11,480
Yeah.

17
00:01:13,599 --> 00:01:16,639
Mo Xuanji has always controlled
the Imperial City's merchant guild.

18
00:01:16,920 --> 00:01:18,239
With her tacit approval,

19
00:01:18,840 --> 00:01:20,559
the guild colludes with local thugs.

20
00:01:21,960 --> 00:01:24,840
Every year they collect protection money
under all sorts of pretexts

21
00:01:25,360 --> 00:01:27,719
and squeeze a fortune
out of the common people.

22
00:01:28,239 --> 00:01:28,880
In the end,

23
00:01:29,519 --> 00:01:30,440
most of it

24
00:01:30,800 --> 00:01:32,639
goes straight into Mo Xuanji's pockets.

25
00:01:33,559 --> 00:01:34,360
How despicable.

26
00:01:36,000 --> 00:01:38,159
Now, under the pretext
of honoring her bet,

27
00:01:38,400 --> 00:01:40,559
she's handed water transport authority
over to me.

28
00:01:41,039 --> 00:01:44,039
But I checked some of the accounts,

29
00:01:46,199 --> 00:01:48,039
and they don't match
the old records at all.

30
00:01:48,440 --> 00:01:50,719
Yinbei Dynasty's water transport trade
has always been stable.

31
00:01:52,239 --> 00:01:53,639
It shouldn't be losing money
year after year.

32
00:01:54,679 --> 00:01:55,840
Do you mean

33
00:01:56,559 --> 00:01:59,840
she not only squeezes the people dry

34
00:02:00,079 --> 00:02:01,760
but skims money
from water transport too?

35
00:02:03,960 --> 00:02:05,039
So

36
00:02:05,719 --> 00:02:07,880
the real account book
must be hidden somewhere.

37
00:02:08,400 --> 00:02:10,159
Knowing Mo Xuanji,

38
00:02:10,599 --> 00:02:12,559
she'd hide it right under her nose

39
00:02:13,239 --> 00:02:14,760
so she can keep an eye on it.

40
00:02:15,519 --> 00:02:18,400
Don't tell me you want me

41
00:02:18,639 --> 00:02:20,719
to use the banquet as cover

42
00:02:20,719 --> 00:02:21,840
and steal the account book back.

43
00:02:23,119 --> 00:02:25,159
My princess consort,
you're truly kindhearted

44
00:02:25,719 --> 00:02:26,800
and hate injustice.

45
00:02:27,320 --> 00:02:31,440
You sure can't stand seeing Mo Xuanji
oppress innocent people.

46
00:02:35,559 --> 00:02:36,360
Hey, you...

47
00:02:36,400 --> 00:02:38,599
Don't put me on a pedestal.

48
00:02:39,159 --> 00:02:40,400
Fine, I'll help you.

49
00:02:41,360 --> 00:02:43,199
I've got a score to settle with her
myself.

50
00:02:44,159 --> 00:02:44,960
Wonderful.

51
00:02:45,519 --> 00:02:46,920
You're truly righteous.

52
00:02:47,039 --> 00:02:48,480
I'm deeply grateful.

53
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:54,800
I'll help you,

54
00:02:55,039 --> 00:02:56,519
but you have to agree to one condition.

55
00:03:02,239 --> 00:03:02,920
Name it.

56
00:03:03,599 --> 00:03:05,760
After I find the account book for you,

57
00:03:06,400 --> 00:03:09,360
all debts between us are wiped clean.

58
00:03:10,360 --> 00:03:10,840
Deal?

59
00:03:12,199 --> 00:03:13,159
Debts?

60
00:03:14,119 --> 00:03:16,280
I never really expected you
to pay me back.

61
00:03:18,639 --> 00:03:19,599
So

62
00:03:19,800 --> 00:03:21,000
you agree to divorce me?

63
00:03:22,679 --> 00:03:23,159
Divorce?

64
00:03:23,239 --> 00:03:23,679
Yeah.

65
00:03:24,920 --> 00:03:25,400
Are you

66
00:03:26,719 --> 00:03:30,000
still angry about me
using you at the banquet?

67
00:03:30,079 --> 00:03:30,519
No.

68
00:03:31,400 --> 00:03:33,360
I just like to read the situation

69
00:03:33,679 --> 00:03:35,599
and find myself a comfortable way
to live.

70
00:03:36,199 --> 00:03:37,159
Besides, Your Highness,

71
00:03:37,440 --> 00:03:39,760
I steal the account book,
cure your poisoning,

72
00:03:40,079 --> 00:03:41,119
and then we divorce.

73
00:03:41,159 --> 00:03:44,119
Isn't that a good deal for you?

74
00:03:47,320 --> 00:03:48,119
Think about it.

75
00:03:52,639 --> 00:03:53,559
Feng Weiyue.

76
00:03:55,119 --> 00:03:57,440
After all we've been through together,

77
00:03:57,800 --> 00:03:58,679
I never thought

78
00:03:59,440 --> 00:04:02,880
you'd still see it all as a transaction.

79
00:04:12,079 --> 00:04:13,159
Fine.

80
00:04:13,840 --> 00:04:15,480
Then it'll be as you say.

81
00:04:15,960 --> 00:04:17,440
Once you get the account book

82
00:04:17,880 --> 00:04:19,199
and cure my poisoning,

83
00:04:20,000 --> 00:04:22,000
I'll divorce you.

84
00:04:24,280 --> 00:04:25,239
Hey!

85
00:04:26,900 --> 00:04:27,320
What...

86
00:04:27,320 --> 00:04:29,880
We were talking fine. Why is he angry?

87
00:04:42,760 --> 00:04:43,719
Yuya.

88
00:04:44,320 --> 00:04:46,920
Mo Xuanji's estate is a den of danger.

89
00:04:47,199 --> 00:04:49,840
Are you really okay
letting Weiyue go alone?

90
00:04:51,239 --> 00:04:52,679
I've already made arrangements.

91
00:04:52,840 --> 00:04:53,519
Otherwise,

92
00:04:53,760 --> 00:04:56,039
why would I let her
walk into danger alone?

93
00:04:56,920 --> 00:04:58,039
However...

94
00:04:59,400 --> 00:05:01,920
Weiyue keeps trying to cut ties with me.

95
00:05:03,800 --> 00:05:05,840
What goes around comes around.

96
00:05:06,280 --> 00:05:08,639
Weiyue used to chase after you,

97
00:05:09,119 --> 00:05:10,599
and you didn't even
spare her a second glance.

98
00:05:11,599 --> 00:05:12,960
Now look what's happening.

99
00:05:12,960 --> 00:05:14,480
She doesn't even look at you.

100
00:05:14,840 --> 00:05:16,880
If you're just here to rub it in,
Mother,

101
00:05:17,719 --> 00:05:19,480
you might as well go back and rest.

102
00:05:20,880 --> 00:05:23,519
You've never been able to take a joke
since childhood.

103
00:05:24,480 --> 00:05:26,360
Weiyue chased you for so long.

104
00:05:26,800 --> 00:05:29,360
Now you chase her just once.

105
00:05:29,559 --> 00:05:30,480
That's not too much to ask, is it?

106
00:05:36,079 --> 00:05:37,119
I understand.

107
00:05:55,440 --> 00:05:56,880
Starting today,

108
00:05:57,119 --> 00:05:59,199
to make sure you get out
of the Grand Princess's Estate safely,

109
00:05:59,599 --> 00:06:01,239
I'm giving you a crash course
in martial arts agility.

110
00:06:02,320 --> 00:06:03,679
Spread your arms.

111
00:06:06,599 --> 00:06:07,960
With martial arts agility
to protect yourself,

112
00:06:08,000 --> 00:06:09,679
I'll feel a little better

113
00:06:10,400 --> 00:06:11,760
about you going to Mo Xuanji's estate.

114
00:06:14,719 --> 00:06:15,239
Ugh.

115
00:06:15,320 --> 00:06:16,280
Don't worry.

116
00:06:16,719 --> 00:06:20,320
I won't send you into battle unprepared.

117
00:06:21,039 --> 00:06:22,719
Let's practice properly.

118
00:06:23,000 --> 00:06:24,320
We start with the horse stance.

119
00:06:24,800 --> 00:06:27,519
Feet shoulder-width apart.

120
00:06:35,440 --> 00:06:36,840
What's wrong with you?

121
00:06:37,280 --> 00:06:39,159
Even military training
isn't this brutal.

122
00:06:39,599 --> 00:06:41,639
Didn't you just say alright?

123
00:06:41,639 --> 00:06:44,719
By alright, I meant after I wake up.

124
00:06:44,960 --> 00:06:45,440
You...

125
00:06:45,599 --> 00:06:47,079
Don't try to lecture me.

126
00:06:47,519 --> 00:06:49,840
Do you know waking someone
from a good dream is unforgivable?

127
00:06:50,239 --> 00:06:51,480
You're impossible.

128
00:06:55,079 --> 00:06:56,119
Yuya

129
00:06:56,159 --> 00:06:57,599
is really thick-headed.

130
00:06:57,840 --> 00:06:59,280
I told him to be nicer to her,

131
00:06:59,559 --> 00:07:01,320
but he just doesn't get it.

132
00:07:05,079 --> 00:07:05,960
What's wrong?

133
00:07:06,039 --> 00:07:07,480
Did my silly son

134
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:09,480
upset my precious daughter-in-law again?

135
00:07:11,280 --> 00:07:11,840
Mother.

136
00:07:12,920 --> 00:07:14,199
No need for formalities.

137
00:07:15,840 --> 00:07:16,679
Mother,

138
00:07:16,960 --> 00:07:19,639
do you think I was ill-mannered
just now?

139
00:07:19,840 --> 00:07:20,639
Not at all.

140
00:07:21,159 --> 00:07:23,039
Seeing your straightforwardness
reminds me

141
00:07:23,239 --> 00:07:26,440
of the days when the former Emperor
and I were young.

142
00:07:28,000 --> 00:07:29,320
We're quite alike.

143
00:07:29,400 --> 00:07:31,159
I truly adore you.

144
00:07:32,880 --> 00:07:35,239
So the former Emperor
had a thing for your type.

145
00:07:35,679 --> 00:07:37,239
Well, but...

146
00:07:37,639 --> 00:07:40,440
Prince of Rong and I
are like fire and water.

147
00:07:40,679 --> 00:07:43,360
I actually think
you two are a perfect match.

148
00:07:47,599 --> 00:07:48,559
Weiyue,

149
00:07:49,000 --> 00:07:50,599
don't blame Yuya for being strict

150
00:07:51,079 --> 00:07:52,960
and cold to everyone.

151
00:07:53,920 --> 00:07:54,840
In fact,

152
00:07:55,280 --> 00:07:56,559
deep down,

153
00:07:57,239 --> 00:07:58,639
he's softer than anyone.

154
00:08:01,199 --> 00:08:02,639
When Yuya was little,

155
00:08:03,079 --> 00:08:05,960
he was supposed to have
an innocent childhood.

156
00:08:06,599 --> 00:08:07,920
But because he was gifted

157
00:08:08,119 --> 00:08:09,760
and deeply favored by
the former Emperor,

158
00:08:10,599 --> 00:08:12,119
wicked people in court

159
00:08:12,519 --> 00:08:14,199
used the former Emperor's love for him

160
00:08:14,639 --> 00:08:15,960
and took Yuya hostage.

161
00:08:17,399 --> 00:08:18,279
I'm sorry, Mother.

162
00:08:18,960 --> 00:08:20,439
This is the first I've heard of it.

163
00:08:21,560 --> 00:08:22,920
It's all right.

164
00:08:23,800 --> 00:08:25,159
Looking back now,

165
00:08:25,439 --> 00:08:28,079
after the kidnapping
when Yuya was young,

166
00:08:28,840 --> 00:08:32,159
the fates of many around him changed.

167
00:08:32,840 --> 00:08:35,000
The former Emperor was left
with a hidden illness

168
00:08:35,319 --> 00:08:36,640
from saving him.

169
00:08:37,399 --> 00:08:38,560
After that,

170
00:08:38,800 --> 00:08:40,800
he worried he didn't have long to live

171
00:08:41,159 --> 00:08:43,199
and became extremely strict with Yuya.

172
00:08:44,279 --> 00:08:47,039
He wanted to force Yuya to grow up fast

173
00:08:47,319 --> 00:08:48,760
and shoulder the great responsibility
early.

174
00:08:49,600 --> 00:08:50,840
And Yuya,

175
00:08:51,159 --> 00:08:52,800
feeling guilty
toward the former Emperor

176
00:08:53,439 --> 00:08:56,720
and carrying the weight of Yinbei
from childhood,

177
00:08:57,199 --> 00:09:00,199
had to give up his innocence early.

178
00:09:00,920 --> 00:09:02,119
He lost his childhood.

179
00:09:08,279 --> 00:09:10,439
So that's what his childhood was like.

180
00:09:14,400 --> 00:09:15,927
(Grand Princess's Estate)

181
00:09:28,680 --> 00:09:30,920
Greetings, Your Highness.

182
00:09:36,720 --> 00:09:38,680
Weiyue, come here.

183
00:09:38,680 --> 00:09:39,760
Mother.

184
00:09:40,640 --> 00:09:42,680
Mother, what brings you here?

185
00:09:43,319 --> 00:09:46,560
Yuya was worried, so he asked me
to come check on you.

186
00:09:52,119 --> 00:09:54,560
I didn't know you'd grace us
with your presence, Dowager Consort.

187
00:09:54,800 --> 00:09:56,239
If we've been remiss in any way,

188
00:09:56,560 --> 00:09:58,119
I beg your forgiveness.

189
00:09:58,560 --> 00:10:00,319
You think
you're worthy to drink with me?

190
00:10:05,880 --> 00:10:07,520
Let me.

191
00:10:09,479 --> 00:10:11,119
What are you doing?

192
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:13,359
How dare you overstep?

193
00:10:13,800 --> 00:10:15,960
Weiyue drank this wine in my place.

194
00:10:15,960 --> 00:10:17,479
That alone was me showing
enough respect.

195
00:10:17,960 --> 00:10:19,720
And I didn't even think it was improper,

196
00:10:19,840 --> 00:10:21,800
yet you dare lecture my daughter-in-law?

197
00:10:22,720 --> 00:10:23,640
I wouldn't dare.

198
00:10:29,119 --> 00:10:30,680
Terrific.

199
00:10:31,319 --> 00:10:34,880
Dowager Consort, Princess Consort,
you have such a harmonious bond.

200
00:10:35,359 --> 00:10:37,399
You two are a model for all of Yinbei.

201
00:10:38,079 --> 00:10:40,920
I've prepared a little game today.

202
00:10:41,560 --> 00:10:44,319
Do you dare to play, Princess Consort?

203
00:10:45,199 --> 00:10:47,079
(Oh, here we go.)

204
00:10:47,760 --> 00:10:48,920
What game?

205
00:10:54,479 --> 00:10:57,479
Participants reach into this black box

206
00:10:58,199 --> 00:11:01,079
and try to name the object inside.

207
00:11:01,840 --> 00:11:03,079
(I thought it'd be something else.)

208
00:11:03,600 --> 00:11:04,840
(It's just a blind box guessing game.)

209
00:11:05,159 --> 00:11:06,399
If I guess right,

210
00:11:06,520 --> 00:11:07,439
what's the prize?

211
00:11:09,000 --> 00:11:11,479
I'll grant you one request.

212
00:11:12,279 --> 00:11:13,359
Anything?

213
00:11:13,560 --> 00:11:14,279
Of course.

214
00:11:16,439 --> 00:11:17,479
Be careful. It could be a trap.

215
00:11:18,159 --> 00:11:19,680
Don't worry, Mother.

216
00:11:49,680 --> 00:11:50,640
You...

217
00:11:54,920 --> 00:11:55,960
Weiyue!

218
00:11:57,720 --> 00:11:58,399
Weiyue!

219
00:11:58,540 --> 00:11:59,300
Weiyue!

220
00:12:15,720 --> 00:12:18,560
♪Dazzling my eyes, impossible to clear♪

221
00:12:18,800 --> 00:12:21,083
♪Mist and clouds lock the frosty sky♪

222
00:12:22,760 --> 00:12:25,121
♪Moon waxes and wanes,
true and false blur♪

223
00:12:25,640 --> 00:12:27,922
♪Coming near, then drifting far♪

224
00:12:28,960 --> 00:12:31,932
♪My heart knows it three thousand times♪

225
00:12:32,520 --> 00:12:34,722
♪Flowers mirrored in clear
shallow water♪

226
00:12:35,880 --> 00:12:40,321
♪Black hair spinning a cocoon,
I step toward love's abyss♪

227
00:12:43,240 --> 00:12:45,601
♪Sword in hand, I spur my horse on♪

228
00:12:46,280 --> 00:12:48,919
♪Love and duty cannot both be whole♪

229
00:12:50,120 --> 00:12:52,720
♪Troubles within and without,
home and realm in peril♪

230
00:12:53,120 --> 00:12:55,281
♪Scattered before my eyes♪

231
00:12:56,560 --> 00:12:59,442
♪Wind and snow cannot blow away
my longing♪

232
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:02,161
♪Letting go is a kind of fulfillment♪

233
00:13:02,880 --> 00:13:04,080
♪This love remains unchanged♪

234
00:13:04,120 --> 00:13:07,600
♪Yet under the moon I make empty wishes♪

235
00:13:09,360 --> 00:13:11,758
♪Ask not of love's poison,
yearning cannot be cut♪

236
00:13:11,920 --> 00:13:15,880
♪In the mortal world jade shatters,
tears of blood run dry♪

237
00:13:16,280 --> 00:13:18,641
♪Ask again of love's poison,
in whose arms will I sleep♪

238
00:13:18,840 --> 00:13:20,680
♪How can I bear a sweet dream♪

239
00:13:20,680 --> 00:13:22,278
♪Turning into doom♪
(Wedding)

240
00:13:23,080 --> 00:13:25,639
♪A path full of thorns,
time won't wait♪

241
00:13:25,680 --> 00:13:29,961
♪I fear this life won't grant us
tender days together♪

242
00:13:30,480 --> 00:13:32,319
♪I don't regret that vow♪

243
00:13:32,560 --> 00:13:35,795
♪Luckily, the phoenix has fallen
into my heart♪
